e.'=>'将各类咨询分别引导到正确去处的按钮。','Pattern titleContact details + map'=>'联系方式 + 地图','Pattern descriptionPhone, email, hours and a map side by side.'=>'电话、电子邮箱、营业时间和地图并排显示。','Pattern titleCall to action (yellow band)'=>'行动号召（黄色横栏）','Pattern descriptionBright band with phone and booking buttons.'=>'带有电话和预约按钮的醒目横栏。','Pattern titlePopular destinations'=>'热门目的地','Pattern descriptionMost-booked destinations from real (anonymised) bookings, with Book buttons.'=>'根据真实（已匿名处理）预约统计的最常预约目的地，附带“预约”按钮。','Pattern titleMeet the drivers'=>'认识我们的司机','Pattern descriptionPublic driver profiles (only drivers who have opted in).'=>'司机公开资料（仅限已选择同意的司机）。','Pattern titleFAQ accordion'=>'常见问题折叠列表','Pattern descriptionFrequently asked questions (edit them under FAQs).'=>'常见问题（请在“常见问题”下编辑）。','Pattern titleFeature cards (3 columns)'=>'特色卡片（3 栏）','Pattern descriptionThree highlight cards — edit the headings and text.'=>'三张重点卡片——可编辑标题和文字。','Purpose-built vehicles'=>'专门设计的车辆','Pattern titleHero banner'=>'主横幅','Pattern descriptionLarge navy banner with headline, intro and booking buttons. Use at the top of a "Blank canvas" page.'=>'大型深蓝色横幅，含主标题、简介和预约按钮。请放在“空白画布”页面的顶部。','Pattern titleAbout Us page'=>'“关于我们”页面','Pattern descriptionStarter content for an About Us page.'=>'“关于我们”页面的初始内容。','Pattern titleAccessibility statement page'=>'无障碍声明页面','Pattern descriptionAccessibility statement draft covering your commitment, features, known limitations and how to give feedback.'=>'无障碍声明草稿，涵盖您的承诺、无障碍功能、已知局限以及如何提供反馈。','Pattern titleDrive with us page'=>'“加入我们当司机”页面','Pattern descriptionStarter content for a driver recruitment page, with [CONFIRM] notes for pay and conditions.'=>'司机招聘页面的初始内容，薪酬和工作条件处附有 [CONFIRM] 提示。','Pattern titleComplaints & feedback page'=>'投诉和反馈页面','Pattern descriptionA clear complaints process with steps, response times ([CONFIRM]) and how to escalate to regulators.'=>'清晰的投诉流程，包括步骤、回复时限（[CONFIRM]）以及如何向监管机构申诉。','What happens next'=>'接下来会怎样','Pattern titlePrivacy policy page'=>'隐私政策页面','Pattern descriptionPrivacy policy that follows the Australian Privacy Principles and updates from your settings, with a request form.'=>'遵循《澳大利亚隐私原则》并根据您的设置自动更新的隐私政策，附申请表。','Pattern titleSeasonal / event landing page'=>'季节性 / 活动着陆页','Pattern descriptionLanding page for an event or season (footy finals, Christmas, spring racing). Schedule it with Publish → Schedule and set "Unpublish automatically".'=>'用于某项活动或季节的着陆页（澳式足球决赛、圣诞节、春季赛马）。请通过“发布 → 定时”安排上线时间，并设置“自动取消发布”。','Pattern titleTerms & cancellation policy page'=>'条款和取消政策页面','Pattern descriptionStructured draft for your booking terms and cancellation policy, with [CONFIRM] notes where your real policy is needed.'=>'预约条款和取消政策的结构化草稿，需要填写您实际政策的地方附有 [CONFIRM] 提示。','Pattern titlePartner logos'=>'合作伙伴标志','Pattern descriptionLogos of partner organisations (only those with permission ticked).'=>'合作机构的标志（仅限已勾选许可的机构）。','Pattern titleBlog: local destination guide'=>'博客：本地目的地指南','Pattern descriptionOutline for posts like "Wheelchair taxi to [hospital]: what to expect".'=>'适用于“乘坐轮椅出租车前往 [医院]：须知事项”这类文章的大纲。','Book a wheelchair taxi'=>'预约轮椅出租车','Pattern titleBlog: travel tips list'=>'博客：出行小贴士清单','Pattern descriptionOutline for step-by-step advice posts.'=>'适用于分步建议类文章的大纲。','Pattern titleAnimated scene: airport drop-off and pickup'=>'动画场景：机场送机和接机','Pattern descriptionDrop-off at Departures, pickup at Arrivals, and a plane taking off. Follows your colours, and visitors can pause it.'=>'在出发大厅送客、在到达大厅接客，还有一架正在起飞的飞机。会跟随您的配色，访客可以暂停。','Pattern titleAnimated scene: door-to-door wheelchair pickup'=>'动画场景：门到门轮椅接送','Pattern descriptionA maxi taxi pulls up, lowers its ramp and a passenger rolls aboard. Follows your colours, and visitors can pause it.'=>'一辆大型出租车停下，放下坡道，一位乘客坐着轮椅上车。会跟随您的配色，访客可以暂停。','Pattern titleAnimated strip: taxis driving by'=>'动画横条：驶过的出租车','Pattern descriptionA narrow road with a maxi taxi and taxis driving past. Follows your colours, and visitors can pause it.'=>'一条窄窄的道路，一辆大型出租车和几辆出租车驶过。会跟随您的配色，访客可以暂停。