s'=>'从 %s 出发的热门行程','Guides for %s'=>'%s 出行指南','Questions about travelling in %s'=>'关于在 %s 出行的问题','Nearby areas'=>'附近区域','Other areas we cover'=>'我们服务的其他区域','Book this trip'=>'预约此行程','More services'=>'更多服务','Ready to book?'=>'准备好预约了吗？','Other services'=>'其他服务','Pages:'=>'页码：','Booking steps'=>'预约步骤','Your trip'=>'您的行程','Street address, suburb'=>'街道地址，区名','e.g. Frankston Hospital, Melbourne Airport'=>'例如：Frankston 医院、墨尔本机场','Estimate only, based on the usual driving route. The final fare depends on traffic, waiting time and route, and any MPTP subsidy is applied by the driver.'=>'仅为估算，根据通常的行车路线计算。最终车费取决于交通状况、等候时间和路线，MPTP 补贴（如有）由司机计算扣除。','I need a return trip'=>'我需要回程','Return pick-up time (if known)'=>'回程上车时间（如已确定）','This is a regular trip (e.g. dialysis, therapy, day program)'=>'这是定期行程（例如透析、治疗、日间活动）','Repeat every'=>'每周重复于','Until'=>'截至','Same times each day, for up to %d weeks. Each trip gets its own reference so it can be changed separately.'=>'每天时间相同，最长 %d 周。每次行程都有自己的预约编号，可以单独更改。','Accessibility needs'=>'无障碍需求','I am a Multi Purpose Taxi Program (MPTP) member'=>'我是多用途出租车计划（MPTP）会员','Anything we should know?'=>'还有什么需要我们知道的吗？','e.g. wheelchair dimensions, carer travelling, assistance to the door, flight number'=>'例如：轮椅尺寸、有护理人员同行、需协助到门口、航班号','How will you pay?'=>'您打算如何付款？','Plan manager, provider or company'=>'计划管理人、服务提供者或公司','NDIS number or purchase order (optional)'=>'NDIS 号码或采购订单号（选填）','After you submit, you will be taken to Stripe’s secure checkout to pay the deposit. The rest of the fare is paid at the end of the trip.'=>'提交后，您将被转到 Stripe 的安全付款页面支付订金。其余车费在行程结束时支付。','Your details'=>'您的资料','I agree to be contacted by phone, SMS or email about this booking, and for you to use the mobility and health details I give to arrange the trip.'=>'我同意你们就此预约通过电话、短信或电子邮件与我联系，并同意你们使用我提供的行动能力和健康信息来安排行程。','I have read and accept the %s.'=>'我已阅读并接受%s。','terms and cancellation policy'=>'条款和取消政策','Request booking'=>'提交预约申请','Travelling in the next hour? Call %s'=>'一小时内出行？请致电 %s','Find your booking'=>'查找您的预约','Enter the reference from your confirmation (it starts with TP-) and the mobile number you booked with.'=>'请输入确认信息中的预约编号（以 TP- 开头）以及预约时使用的手机号码。','Show my booking'=>'显示我的预约','Lost your reference? Call %s.'=>'找不到预约编号？请致电 %s。','Online deposit'=>'在线订金','Thanks — we have received your request.'=>'谢谢——我们已收到您的申请。','Our team will contact you to confirm.'=>'我们的团队会与您联系确认。','Payment complete — thank you.'=>'付款完成——谢谢您。','It can take a minute for the payment to show below.'=>'付款可能需要一分钟左右才会显示在下方。','The payment was not completed. You can try again below or pay the driver.'=>'付款未完成。您可以在下方重试，或向司机付款。','This booking has been cancelled.'=>'此预约已取消。','Our driver arrived but could not find you, so this trip was marked as a no-show. Please call us if this is a mistake.'=>'我们的司机已到达，但没有找到您，因此本次行程被记录为“乘客未到”。如有误会，请致电我们。','Your driver is on the way.'=>'您的司机正在路上。','Your driver has arrived.'=>'您的司机已到达。','Booking progress'=>'预约进度','Time to be arranged'=>'时间待定','%1$d passenger(s), %2$d wheelchair(s)'=>'%1$d 位乘客，%2$d 台轮椅','estimate only'=>'仅为估算','Your notes'=>'您的备注','Pay %s deposit securely'=>'安全支付 %s 订金','This is part of a repeat booking (%d trips)'=>'这是重复预约中的一次行程（共 %d 次）','Your %s is with our team. We will contact you shortly.'=>'您的%s已转交我们的团队。我们会尽快与您联系。','Change or cancel this booking'=>'更改或取消此预约','What would you like to do?'=>'您想做什么？','Change the time, address or details'=>'更改时间、地址或详情','Cancel this trip'=>'取消此行程','Cancel all remaining trips in this repeat booking'=>'取消此重复预约中所有剩余的行程','e.g. Please change the pick-up to 10:15am'=>'例如：请把上车时间改为上午 10:15','Requests are handled by our team. For changes within the next two hours, please call us.'=>'申请由我们的团队处理。如需更改两小时内的行程，请致电我们。','Questions about your trip? Call %s.'=>'对行程有疑问？请致电 %s。','Thanks — your booking request is in!'=>'谢谢——您的预约申请已提交！','Your reference'=>'您的预约编号','%d trip has been requested.'=>'已申请 %d 次行程。','Each trip has its own reference, listed in your confirmation email.'=>'每次行程都有自己的预约编号，列在您的确认电子邮件中。','We saved your booking but could not open the online payment page. You can pay the driver instead, or try again from your booking page.'=>'我们已保存您的预约，但无法打开在线付款页面。您可以改为向司机付款，或在预约页面重试。','We confirm your booking'=>'我们确认您的预约','By SMS or email — usually within the hour during opening times.'=>'通过短信或电子邮件——营业时间内通常在一小时内确认。','Your driver is assigned'=>'为您指派司机','We text you their first name and the vehicle.'=>'我们会用短信告诉您司机的名字和车辆。','On the day'=>'出行当天','You get a text when your driver is on the way and when they arrive.'=>'司机出发前往和到达时，您都会收到短信。','View booking'=>'查看预约','Book the return trip'=>'预约回程','Make another booking'=>'再预约一次','See all your trips in My Account'=>'在“我的账户”中查看所有行程','Book often? %s to see every trip in one place and rebook in one tap.'=>'经常预约？%s，即可在一处查看所有行程，并一键重新预约。','Create a free account'=>'创建免费账户','Need to change something? Call %s and quote your reference.'=>'需要更改？请致电 %s，并提供您的预约编号。','Nothing here yet'=>'这里暂时还没有内容','No results matched your search. Try different words.'=>'没有与您的搜索相符的结果。请换个词试试。','Check back soon for news and travel tips.'=>'请稍后再来查看新闻和出行小贴士。','a trip to %s'=>'前往 %s 的行程','Guide'=>'指南','to travelling to %s'=>'：前往 %s 出行','Rear-entry ramps or hoists and four-point restraints, so you can stay in your own chair.'=>'后门进入的坡道或升降机，以及四点式固定带，让您可以一直坐在自己的轮椅上。','Trained, accredited drivers'=>'训练有素的持证司机','Our drivers are experienced in loading, securing and assisting passengers with a disability.'=>'我们的司机在协助残障乘客上车、固定轮椅和提供帮助方面经验丰富。','Punctual, 24/7'=>'准时守约，全天候服务','Book ahead for appointments and flights, or call us for a same-day pick-up.'=>'就医预约和航班请提前预约，当天接送请致电我们。','Carers welcome'=>'欢迎护理人员同行','Family members and support workers can travel with you at no extra hassle.'=>'家人和支持工作者可以轻松地与您同行。','Prefer to talk to someone?'=>'想和真人通话？','See all FAQs'=>'查看所有常见问题','Pickups from your door'=>'上门接送','Our maxi taxis back up close, lower the ramp and help you aboard. You stay in your own chair, secured with four-point restraints.'=>'我们的大型出租车会倒车靠近，放下坡道并扶您上车。您可以一直坐在自己的轮椅上，并用四点式固定带固定。','Book a pickup'=>'预约接送','Airport drop-offs & pickups'=>'机场送机和接机','Straight to Departures, and waiting at Arrivals when you land — with room for luggage and mobility equipment.'=>'直接送到出发大厅，您落地时我们在到达大厅等候——还有足够空间放行李和助行设备。','Book an airport transfer'=>'预约机场接送','All articles'=>'所有文章','Start a booking'=>'开始预约','Where to?'=>'去哪里？','Continue'=>'继续','Suburbs in this article'=>'本文涉及的区','Travelling in this area?'=>'在这个地区出行？','Keep reading'=>'继续阅读','About our service in numbers'=>'用数字了解我们的服务','Send your request'=>'提交您的申请','Takes about two minutes.'=>'大约只需两分钟。','We confirm'=>'我们确认','Ride in comfort'=>'舒适出行','Rated %1$s out of 5 from %2$d Google review'=>'Google 评分 %1$s 分（满分 5 分），共 %2$d 条评价','Rated %s out of 5 on Google'=>'Google 评分 %s 分（满分 5 分）','%d out of 5 stars'=>'%d 星（满分 5 星）','View on Google'=>'在 Google 上查看','Reviews from Google, shown as written by reviewers.'=>'来自 Google 的评价，按评价者原文显示。','Read or leave a review on Google'=>'在 Google 上阅读或发表评价','Your trip so far'=>'您目前的行程信息','Travelling'=>'出行人员','Estimate'=>'估算','Return'=>'回程','See exactly how our drivers load, secure and unload a wheelchair — so you know what to expect before your first trip.'=>'看看我们的司机如何让轮椅上车、固定轮椅和下车——让您在第一次乘车前就心中有数。','Read the transcript'=>'阅读文字稿','Play video: %s (with captions)'=>'播放视频：%s（带字幕）','Plays from YouTube (privacy-enhanced mode).'=>'通过 YouTube 播放（隐私增强模式）。','Plays from Vimeo.'=>'通过 Vimeo 播放。','FAQ'=>'常见问题','Book a Taxi'=>'预约出租车','Manage My Booking'=>'管理我的预约','My Account'=>'我的账户','Contact Us'=>'联系我们','Our Fleet'=>'我们的车队','Driver Jobs'=>'司机任务','Our Services'=>'我们的服务','About Us'=>'关于我们','NDIS & Aged Care'=>'NDIS 与老年护理','Privacy Policy'=>'隐私政策','Accessibility Statement'=>'无障碍声明','Terms & Cancellation Policy'=>'条款与取消政策','Complaints & Feedback'=>'投诉与反馈','Drive With Us'=>'加入我们当司机',' and more'=>' 等地区','%1$s is in %2$s.'=>'%1$s 位于 %2$s。','%1$s picks up wheelchair users from %2$s in ramp and hoist vans, with the driver meeting you at the pick-up point and helping you on board.'=>'%1$s 使用配有坡道和升降机的车辆，从 %2$s 接载轮椅乘客，司机会在上车地点与您会合，并协助您上车。','%1$s provides %2$s in %3$s%4$s, using ramp and hoist vans with wheelchair restraints and drivers who help you from door to door.'=>'%1$s 在 %3$s 提供%2$s%4$s，使用配有坡道、升降机和轮椅固定装置的车辆，司机会协助您门到门出行。','%1$s takes wheelchair users to %2$s in ramp and hoist vans and drops you at the accessible entrance, with help from the driver.'=>'%1$s 使用配有坡道和升降机的车辆，送轮椅乘客前往 %2$s，并由司机协助您在无障碍入口下车。','%1$s: thanks for travelling with us. How was your trip? %2$s'=>'%1$s：感谢您乘坐我们的车。这次行程怎么样？%2$s','%d min read'=>'约 %d 分钟阅读','%d seat'=>'%d 个座位','%s ("we", "us") provides wheelchair accessible taxi transport. This policy explains what personal information we collect, why, who we share it with and how you can see, correct or delete it. We follow the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs).'=>'%s（“我们”）提供轮椅无障碍出租车服务。本政策说明我们收集哪些个人信息、收集原因、与谁共享，以及您如何查看、更正或删除这些信息。我们遵守《1988 年隐私法》（联邦）和《澳大利亚隐私原则》（APPs）。','%s off'=>'优惠 %s','%s or later — when ready'=>'%s 或之后 — 准备好时','(opens WhatsApp)'=>'（打开 WhatsApp）','1 wheelchair'=>'1 辆轮椅','2 wheelchairs'=>'2 辆轮椅','7 days'=>'每周 7 天','A guide only, not to scale. Not on the map? Ask us — we travel further on request.'=>'仅供参考，未按比例绘制。地图上没有您的地点？请询问我们 — 如有需要，我们可以去更远的地方。','A question about a booking'=>'关于预订的问题','A rough guide without traffic. We allow extra time for loading your wheelchair.'=>'不含交通拥堵的大致时间。我们会预留额外时间安置您的轮椅。','ABN'=>'ABN','About the author'=>'关于作者','About this policy'=>'关于本政策','Access'=>'无障碍设施','Accessible drop-off and pick-up points'=>'无障碍下车点和上车点','Accessible entrance'=>'无障碍入口','Accessible taxis for %s.'=>'为 %s 提供无障碍出租车。','Accessible transport glossary'=>'无障碍交通术语表','Account'=>'账户','Accounts: until you delete your account.'=>'账户信息：保留至您删除账户为止。','Add %s'=>'添加%s','Add to home screen'=>'添加到主屏幕','Afternoon (12pm – 5pm)'=>'下午（中午 12 点 – 下午 5 点）','Airport'=>'机场','All glossary terms'=>'所有术语','Anything else we should know'=>'还有其他需要我们了解的情况吗','Anything that helps us recognise it'=>'任何有助于我们辨认的信息','Anything we should know before we call? (optional)'=>'我们致电之前，有什么需要了解的吗？（可选）','Area'=>'地区','Arriving by plane? Flight number (optional)'=>'乘飞机抵达？航班号（可选）','Articles'=>'文章','As soon as possible'=>'尽快','Ask us to call you'=>'请我们给您回电','At the other end we help you to the door, reception or check-in.'=>'到达目的地后，我们会协助您到门口、前台或登记处。','Australia, with some processing overseas'=>'澳大利亚，部分在海外处理','Automatic booking is paused until %s.'=>'自动预订已暂停，直至 %s。','Bank transfer'=>'银行转账','Bass Strait'=>'巴斯海峡','Best time to call'=>'方便接听电话的时间','Biller Code'=>'Biller Code（缴费机构代码）','Book %s'=>'预订 %s','Book a pick-up from %s'=>'预订从 %s 出发的接载','Book a ride'=>'预订行程','Book a ride home from here'=>'从这里预订回家的车','Book a trip first — then you can save it here as a regular trip.'=>'请先预订一次行程，之后即可在此将其保存为常用行程。','Book a trip here'=>'在此预订行程','Book a trip to %s'=>'预订前往 %s 的行程','Book an accessible taxi home, to an appointment or anywhere you need to go. Your pick-up address is already filled in.'=>'预订无障碍出租车回家、去看病或去任何您需要去的地方。您的上车地址已自动填好。','Book online in about two minutes or call %1$s. %2$s'=>'在线预订大约只需两分钟，或致电 %1$s。%2$s','Book online in about two minutes or call %s; carers travel with you and MPTP, NDIS and aged-care accounts are accepted.'=>'在线预订大约只需两分钟，或致电 %s；护理人员可与您同行，并接受 MPTP、NDIS 和养老护理账户。','Book online or by phone, we confirm, and your driver helps you from door to door.'=>'在线或电话预订，我们会确认，司机会协助您门到门出行。','Book online or call us — tell us about your wheelchair and anything the driver should know.'=>'在线预订或致电我们 — 告诉我们您的轮椅情况，以及司机需要了解的任何事项。','Book these trips for me automatically, a week ahead'=>'提前一周为我自动预订这些行程','Book your trip'=>'预订您的行程','Booked automatically a week ahead. You get an email for each trip and can cancel any of them.'=>'提前一周自动预订。每次行程您都会收到一封电子邮件，并可取消其中任何一次。','Booking reference (if you have it)'=>'预订编号（如有）','Booking takes about two minutes'=>'预订大约只需两分钟','Booking takes about two minutes. We confirm by SMS or email.'=>'预订大约只需两分钟。我们会通过 SMS 或电子邮件确认。','By SMS or email, with your driver’s name and vehicle once assigned.'=>'通过 SMS 或电子邮件通知，分配司机后会告知司机姓名和车辆信息。','