ager we invoice and an NDIS number or purchase order.'=>'付款和资助信息：您的付款方式、多用途出租车计划（MPTP）会员资格；如为账户行程，还包括我们开具发票的机构或计划管理人，以及 NDIS 编号或采购订单号。','People travelling'=>'乘车人员','People you ask us to deal with, such as the coordinator, plan manager or facility that booked or pays for your trip.'=>'您要求我们联系的人，例如为您预订或支付行程费用的协调员、计划管理人或机构。','Phone number'=>'电话号码','Phone:'=>'电话：','Pick up when ready'=>'准备好后接载','Pick-up point'=>'上车地点','Pick-up point:'=>'上车地点：','Pick-up time (if known)'=>'上车时间（如知道）','Places we go'=>'我们前往的地点','Plan to arrive about %1$d minutes early — by %2$s. Choose a point and we will fill in the booking for you.'=>'请计划提前约 %1$d 分钟到达 — 即 %2$s 之前。选择一个地点，我们会为您填写预订信息。','Please call us.'=>'请致电我们。','Please choose a pick-up time.'=>'请选择上车时间。','Please choose one of your trips.'=>'请选择您的一次行程。','Please contact %s first. We will look into your concern and reply within 30 days.'=>'请先联系 %s。我们会调查您的问题，并在 30 天内答复。','Popular pages'=>'热门页面','Port Phillip Bay'=>'菲利普港湾（Port Phillip Bay）','Port Phillip Bay and the Mornington Peninsula, with these places marked: %s.'=>'菲利普港湾和莫宁顿半岛，图中标出以下地点：%s。','Post:'=>'邮寄地址：','Prefer to talk? Call %s.'=>'想直接通话？请致电 %s。','Previous reviews'=>'上一组评价','Prices and quotes'=>'价格和报价','Print'=>'打印','Print trip confirmation'=>'打印行程确认单','Promo code'=>'优惠码','Promo code (optional)'=>'优惠码（可选）','Put the earliest likely time above (or leave it empty). When you are ready, tap "I’m ready" on your booking page or call us, and we will send the driver.'=>'请在上方填写最早可能的时间（或留空）。准备好后，请在预订页面点按“我准备好了”或致电我们，我们会派司机过来。','Questions about wheelchair taxis and %s'=>'关于轮椅出租车和 %s 的问题','Questions about wheelchair taxis in %s'=>'关于 %s 轮椅出租车的问题','Questions and complaints'=>'问题和投诉','Quote'=>'报价','Railway station'=>'火车站','Railway stations and shopping centres'=>'火车站和购物中心','Ramps or hoists and wheelchair restraints in every vehicle'=>'每辆车都配有坡道或升降机以及轮椅固定装置','Rather talk to someone? Ask us to call you back.'=>'想和工作人员通话？请让我们给您回电。','Ratings and comments you give about a trip, and messages you send us.'=>'您对行程的评分和意见，以及您发给我们的信息。','Read all reviews on Google'=>'在 Google 上阅读所有评价','Ready to be picked up?'=>'准备好上车了吗？','Rear ramp'=>'后置坡道','Ref'=>'编号','Regular trip'=>'常用行程','Regular trips'=>'常用行程','Regular trips for an organisation'=>'机构的常用行程','Report lost item'=>'报告遗失物品','Request a quote'=>'申请报价','Return pick-up (optional)'=>'回程接载（可选）','Reviews — scroll sideways for more'=>'评价 — 左右滑动查看更多','Rosebud Hospital'=>'Rosebud 医院','Save a regular trip'=>'保存常用行程','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Save regular trip'=>'保存常用行程','Save trips you make often — dialysis, day programs, work — and book the next one in one tap, or let us book them automatically a week ahead.'=>'保存您经常乘坐的行程 — 透析、日间活动、上班 — 一键预订下一次，或让我们提前一周自动为您预订。','Search %s'=>'搜索%s','See all suburbs we cover there'=>'查看我们在该地区服务的所有城区','See our fleet'=>'查看我们的车队','See upcoming events'=>'查看即将举行的活动','Seeing, correcting or deleting your information'=>'查看、更正或删除您的信息','Send me occasional news and offers by email and SMS. You can unsubscribe at any time.'=>'通过电子邮件和 SMS 偶尔向我发送新闻和优惠。您可以随时取消订阅。','Service'=>'服务','Service providers who help us run the business:'=>'协助我们运营业务的服务提供商：','Show more: %s'=>'显示更多：%s','Sign up'=>'注册','Some of our service providers store or process information outside Australia:'=>'我们的部分服务提供商在澳大利亚境外存储或处理信息：','Something else'=>'其他事项','Something went wrong — please contact me about this trip'=>'出现问题 — 请就此行程与我联系','Sorry, that did not work on this device. We will still text you.'=>'抱歉，此功能在本设备上无法使用。我们仍会给您发短信。','Suburb'=>'城区','Tap the button once you have been discharged or your appointment is finished. We will send the driver straight away.'=>'出院或看完病后，请点按此按钮。我们会立即派司机过来。','Tell us about your chair when you book and we will send the right vehicle.'=>'预订时请告诉我们您的轮椅情况，我们会派出合适的车辆。','Tell us where and when — the next step takes about a minute.'=>'告诉我们地点和时间 — 下一步大约只需一分钟。','Tell us where, when and about your wheelchair. It takes about two minutes.'=>'告诉我们地点、时间和您的轮椅情况。大约只需两分钟。','Thanks — we have let the office and your driver know you are ready. We will text you when the driver is on the way.'=>'谢谢 — 我们已通知办公室和您的司机您已准备好。司机出发时我们会给您发短信。','That page has moved or no longer exists. You can still book, check a booking or call us — we are happy to help.'=>'该页面已移动或不存在。您仍然可以预订、查看预订或致电我们 — 我们很乐意为您提供帮助。','The driver doing your trip sees your name, phone number, addresses and the needs you have told us about. Drivers only see their own trips.'=>'负责您行程的司机可以看到您的姓名、电话号码、地址以及您告诉我们的需求。司机只能看到自己负责的行程。','The return pick-up needs to be after the first pick-up time.'=>'回程接载时间需要晚于第一次接载时间。','This event has finished.'=>'此活动已结束。','This link has expired. Please call us.'=>'此链接已过期。请致电我们。','Tips from our drivers for %s'=>'我们的司机关于 %s 的小贴士','To arrange, run and change your trips, and send the right vehicle.'=>'用于安排、执行和更改您的行程，并派出合适的车辆。','To meet our legal obligations, including commercial passenger vehicle and tax laws.'=>'用于履行我们的法律义务，包括商业载客车辆法规和税法。','To send booking confirmations and updates by SMS and email, such as when your driver is on the way.'=>'通过 SMS 和电子邮件发送预订确认和最新动态，例如司机出发时通知您。','To take payment, issue receipts and invoices, and process MPTP and NDIS claims.'=>'用于收款、开具收据和发票，以及处理 MPTP 和 NDIS 报销。','Trained, patient and local — the people who will help you aboard.'=>'训练有素、耐心细致的本地司机 — 他们会协助您上车。','Trip details: pick-up and drop-off addresses, dates and times, number of passengers, and the vehicle you need.'=>'行程信息：上车和下车地址、日期和时间、乘客人数以及您需要的车辆。','Trips: we keep trip records while we need them to run the business, and remove details when you ask.'=>'行程记录：在业务运营需要期间，我们会保存行程记录；如您要求，我们会删除相关信息。','United Kingdom and other countries'=>'英国及其他国家','United States and other countries'=>'美国及其他国家','Updates every 20 seconds. Map © OpenStreetMap contributors.'=>'每 20 秒更新一次。地图 © OpenStreetMap 贡献者。','Urgent — medication, keys, a mobility aid? Call %s.'=>'急需 — 药物、钥匙、助行器？请致电 %s。','Vehicles built for wheelchairs'=>'专为轮椅设计的车辆','View %s'=>'查看%s','Visiting hours, maps and contacts for %s (official website)'=>'%s 的探视时间、地图和联系方式（官方网站）','Want to drive with us? Apply here.'=>'想成为我们的司机？请在此申请。','Ways to pay your invoice'=>'支付发票的方式','We choose providers with strong security and privacy commitments, and only share what they need to do their job.'=>'我们选择在安全和隐私方面有严格承诺的服务提供商，并且只向他们提供完成工作所需的信息。','We confirm by SMS or email, then text you your driver’s name and vehicle.'=>'我们会通过 SMS 或电子邮件确认，然后发短信告知您司机的姓名和车辆信息。','We cover %s and more — type the full street address.'=>'我们的服务范围包括 %s 等地区 — 请输入完整的街道地址。','We do not sell your information, and we do not send marketing messages without your permission.'=>'我们不会出售您的信息，未经您的许可也不会向您发送营销信息。','We keep a log of who changes each booking and when.'=>'我们会记录每项预订由谁、在何时更改。','We pick up from every address in %1$s, including %2$s.'=>'我们在 %1$s 的所有地址接载乘客，包括 %2$s。','We text you when they are on the way, then help you aboard and secure your chair.'=>'司机出发时我们会给您发短信，然后司机会协助您上车并固定好您的轮椅。','We text you when your driver is on the way'=>'司机出发时我们会给您发短信','We travel anywhere across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula, including hospitals, day programs and Melbourne and Avalon airports, and carers travel with you.'=>'我们的服务覆盖墨尔本和莫宁顿半岛各地，包括医院、日间活动中心以及墨尔本机场和 Avalon 机场，护理人员可与您同行。','Website information: your IP address (to stop spam and misuse) and, only if you accept analytics cookies, how you use the website.'=>'网站信息：您的 IP 地址（用于防止垃圾信息和滥用），以及仅在您接受分析 Cookie 的情况下，您使用网站的方式。','Wedding'=>'婚礼','Western Port'=>'西港湾（Western Port）','What did you lose?'=>'您遗失了什么物品？','What else do people ask?'=>'人们还会问什么？','What happens when I book?'=>'预订后会怎样？','What is %s?'=>'什么是 %s？','What is it about?'=>'是关于什么的？','What is it for?'=>'用途是什么？','What passengers say'=>'乘客评价','What passengers say about trips from %s'=>'乘客对从 %s 出发的行程的评价','What should I know about getting around %s?'=>'在 %s 出行需要了解什么？','What trips can I book from %s?'=>'我可以预订从 %s 出发的哪些行程？','What trips can I book in %s?'=>'我可以在 %s 预订哪些行程？','What we collect'=>'我们收集哪些信息','WhatsApp us'=>'通过 WhatsApp 联系我们','Wheelchair Accessible Taxis'=>'轮椅无障碍出租车','Wheelchair accessible taxi pick-ups from %1$s: where to wait, step-free access and how to book. Ramp and hoist vans. Call %2$s.'=>'从 %1$s 出发的轮椅无障碍出租车接载：在哪里等候、无台阶通道以及如何预订。配有坡道和升降机的车辆。请致电 %2$s。','Wheelchair accessible taxi services'=>'轮椅无障碍出租车服务','Wheelchair accessible taxi to %1$s: the accessible entrance, where we drop you off, parking and how to book. Ramp and hoist vans. Call %2$s.'=>'前往 %1$s 的轮椅无障碍出租车：无障碍入口、下车地点、停车以及如何预订。配有坡道和升降机的车辆。请致电 %2$s。','Wheelchair accessible taxis across %1$s: %2$s. Ramp and hoist vans, trained drivers. Book online or call %3$s.'=>'覆盖 %1$s 各地的轮椅无障碍出租车：%2$s。配有坡道和升降机的车辆，训练有素的司机。在线预订或致电 %3$s。','Wheelchair accessible taxis in every council area we cover across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula.'=>'我们在墨尔本和莫宁顿半岛服务的每个市议会区域提供轮椅无障碍出租车。','Wheelchair accessible taxis in every suburb of these council areas.'=>'在这些市议会区域的每个城区提供轮椅无障碍出租车。','Wheelchair taxi booking'=>'轮椅出租车预订','Wheelchair taxi from %s'=>'从 %s 出发的轮椅出租车','Wheelchair taxi in %s'=>'%s 的轮椅出租车','Wheelchair taxi to %s'=>'前往 %s 的轮椅出租车','Wheelchair taxi to the event'=>'乘坐轮椅出租车前往活动','Wheelchair taxis to events'=>'前往活动的轮椅出租车','Wheelchair?'=>'使用轮椅？','Where do I wait for my taxi at %s?'=>'在 %s 我应该在哪里等出租车？','Where do people often travel to from %s?'=>'人们通常从 %s 去哪里？','Where do we drop you off at %s?'=>'我们在 %s 的哪里送您下车？','Where do we pick you up at %s?'=>'我们在 %s 的哪里接您？','Where is my driver?'=>'我的司机在哪里？','Where we pick you up'=>'我们在哪里接您','Where will you drop me off at %s?'=>'在 %s 你们会在哪里让我下车？','Which parts of %s do you cover?'=>'你们服务 %s 的哪些地区？','Which suburbs in %s do you cover?'=>'你们服务 %s 的哪些城区？','Who we share it with'=>'我们与谁共享信息','Why book with us'=>'为什么选择我们','Why we use it'=>'我们为什么使用这些信息','Written by'=>'作者','Yes. Book a return trip with an approximate time, then call or text us when you are ready. Appointments often run late, so we keep return pick-ups flexible.'=>'可以。请预订回程并填写大致时间，准备好后致电或发短信给我们。看病常常会延误，所以我们的回程接载时间很灵活。','Yes. Book a time, or call us when you are ready. If your train is running late, just let us know and we will adjust the pick-up.'=>'可以。请预订时间，或准备好后致电我们。如果您的火车晚点，请告诉我们，我们会调整接载时间。','Yes. Carers, family and assistance animals are welcome. Include everyone in the passenger count so we send a vehicle with enough seats.'=>'可以。欢迎护理人员、家人和辅助动物同行。请把所有人都计入乘客人数，以便我们派出座位足够的车辆。','Yes. Coordinators, case managers and aged-care staff can open a coordinator account to book for several clients, see every trip and download monthly trip logs and invoices.'=>'可以。协调员、个案经理和养老护理人员可以开设协调员账户，为多位客户预订、查看每次行程，并下载每月行程记录和发票。','Yes. Most manual and power wheelchairs fit, and you stay seated in your chair. Tell us the make, width and weight when you book so we send the right vehicle. Mobility scooters can travel when they can be safely restrained — please check with us first.'=>'可以。大多数手动轮椅和电动轮椅都可以上车，您可以一直坐在自己的轮椅上。预订时请告诉我们轮椅的品牌、宽度和重量，以便我们派出合适的车辆。代步车在能够安全固定的情况下可以乘车 — 请先与我们确认。','You can ask about our services without giving your name. To book a trip we need enough detail to collect you and contact you.'=>'您可以在不提供姓名的情况下咨询我们的服务。预订行程时，我们需要足够的信息来接载和联系您。','You can ask for a copy of the information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. It is free. If you have an account, you can update your details, download your data and delete your account yourself in My Account. Otherwise use the form below or contact us. We will check it is really you and reply within 30 days. If we cannot do what you ask — for example because the law requires us to keep invoices — we will tell you why.'=>'您可以要求获取我们所持有的您的信息副本，要求我们更正或删除这些信息。这是免费的。如果您有账户，可以在“我的账户”中自行更新信息、下载数据和删除账户。否则，请使用下方表格或联系我们。我们会核实您的身份，并在 30 天内答复。如果我们无法满足您的要求 — 例如法律要求我们保留发票 — 我们会告诉您原因。','You will see your driver here once they are on the way and sharing their location.'=>'司机出发并共享位置后，您可以在此看到司机。','Your driver arrives'=>'司机到达','Your driver is about %d minute away.'=>'您的司机大约还有 %d 分钟到达。','Your driver lowers the ramp, helps you aboard and secures your chair with four-point restraints.'=>'司机会放下坡道，协助您上车，并用四点式固定装置固定好您的轮椅。','about %d min'=>'约 %d 分钟','e.g. Dialysis'=>'例如：透析','e.g. Frankston Hospital to Mornington'=>'例如：Frankston 医院到 Mornington','e.g. QF432'=>'例如：QF432','e.g. black handbag, hearing aid, phone'=>'例如：黑色手提包、助听器、手机','e.g. waiting time, stops on the way, wedding schedule, wheelchair size.'=>'例如：等候时间、途中停靠、婚礼日程、轮椅尺寸。','on your invoice'=>'在您的发票上','return %s'=>'回程 %s','sending booking text messages'=>'发送预订短信','since %d'=>'自 %d 年起','taking card payments — we never see or store your card number'=>'处理银行卡付款 — 我们从不查看或存储您的卡号','the map showing where your driver is on your booking page (your browser loads the map pictures from OpenStreetMap). The driver’s location is only shared while they are on the way to you and is deleted when the trip ends'=>'预订页面上显示司机位置的地图（您的浏览器会从 OpenStreetMap 加载地图图片）。司机的位置仅在其前往接您的途中共享，并在行程结束后删除','we will call you when the office opens.'=>'办公室开门后我们会给您回电。','wheelchair accessible taxis'=>'轮椅无障碍出租车','your invoice will show your own reference number.'=>'您的发票上会显示您自己的参考编号。','your mobility aid, chair size and weight, and any needs you tell us about so the driver can help you safely. This is "sensitive information" under the APPs. We only collect it with your consent, and only what we need for your trip.'=>'您的助行器、轮椅尺寸和重量，以及您告诉我们的任何需求，以便司机能安全地协助您。根据 APPs，这属于“敏感信息”。我们只在征得您同意后收集，并且只收集您的行程所需的信息。','Font family nameAtkinson Hyperlegible'=>'Atkinson Hyperlegible','Font size nameLarge'=>'大','Please enter an Australian phone number, e.g. 0412 345 678 or (03) 9123 4567.'=>'请输入澳大利亚电话号码，例如 0412 345 678 或 (03) 9123 4567。','Please enter a mobile number starting with 04, so we can send texts.'=>'请输入以 04 开头的手机号码，以便我们发送短信。','That looks like a landline — we will call you instead of sending texts.'=>'这看起来是固定电话——我们会给您打电话，而不是发送短信。']];